SUMMARY:Boch Exotics Toys for Tots Live Broadcast
LOCATION:Boch Exotics — 441 Providence Highway\, Norwood\, MA 02062
DESCRIPTION:Ernie Boch Jr. and WEEI’s Greg Hill Show host the 22nd annual Toys for Tots broadcast\, with live music\, complimentary breakfast\, special guests and Santa. Bring new\, unwrapped toys\; toy donations must arrive by 9 AM\, although the broadcast continues until 10 AM. Before the broadcast\, drop off toys during showroom hours: Monday–Friday 9 AM–6 PM or Saturday 9 AM–5 PM\; closed Sunday. Check with the dealership for holiday exceptions.\nSource: https://www.bochexotics.com/toys-for-tots-at-boch-exotics-norwood-ma.htm
URL:https://www.bochexotics.com/toys-for-tots-at-boch-exotics-norwood-ma.htm
