DESCRIPTION:Public trivia fundraiser at Knights of Columbus Hall\, 572 Nichols Street\, Norwood\, on January 23\, 2027 at 7 PM. Entry is $25 per person\; teams of 6–8 encouraged\, smaller teams welcome (maximum eight). Complimentary desserts and snacks\; cash bar. Register and pay through SMILE Mass's official form. No registration closing date or event end time is stated.\nCost: $25 per person\nSource: https://smilemass.org/social-rec-activities/
