BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-01-23-tlc-pickleball-fundraiser@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261128T134118Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270123
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270124
SUMMARY:TLC Adult Pickleball Tournament Fundraiser
LOCATION:The Learning Center for the Deaf — 848 Central Street\, Framingham\, MA 01701
DESCRIPTION:Out of Town — Framingham\, MA. TLC’s third adult pickleball tournament raises funds for its March 2027 National Deaf Junior Pickleball Tournament for Deaf and hard-of-hearing high-school students. $60 per player\; ages 18+\, all skill levels\, coed scramble with no partner required. This event is for Deaf and hard-of-hearing participants and signers\; interpreters will not be present. Bring your own paddle. Playing-session times will be announced after registration closes. Snow date: January 30\, 2027.\nCost: $60 per player\nSource: https://www.tlcdeaf.org/tlc-pickleball-tournament
URL:https://www.tlcdeaf.org/tlc-pickleball-tournament
END:VEVENT
