SUMMARY:Murphy-Donoghue Nursing Scholarship Fundraiser
LOCATION:Norwood Elks Lodge No. 1124 — 152 Winslow Avenue\, Norwood\, MA 02062
DESCRIPTION:The second annual benefit remembers Lisa Donoghue and Rick Murphy. Proceeds fund a nursing-degree scholarship for a Tri-County Regional Vocational Technical High School student. Public ticketed event at Norwood Elks Lodge\, 152 Winslow Avenue\, beginning at 5 PM. Use the organizer’s Eventbrite page for tickets and current prices.\nSource: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/murphy-donoghue-nursing-scholarship-fundraiser-tickets-2004253316623
